# Admin UI

- Use shared partials under `app/views/brawo_cms/admin/shared/` (`_form_errors`, `_page_header`, `_status_badge`) instead of copying markup.
- Field rendering: `FieldsHelper#display_field_value` / `#render_field_input` → `FieldFactory` → `BrawoCms::Fields::*`.
- Layout/wrapper widths: `FieldWrapperHelper` only.
- Page builder: `PageBuilderHelper` — include on controllers that render page builder forms, not globally.
- i18n keys under `brawo.*` in `config/locales/brawo.en.yml`.
- Destroy links: `data: { turbo_method: :delete }` with `turbo_confirm` where appropriate.
- Host apps can override engine views via standard Rails engine view paths (documented in `docs/admin.md`).
